        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Mix of two types of cable. Data from one producer of such cables.\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes material, an estimation of the production efforts (transportation, energy, process chemicals, …) and of the infrastructure for the production of a three-conductor cable used in the construction of new buildings. No information about emissions (air, water) and waste are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
